+// batch 1 (Fix 41), (c) 2026 Mong00se: the program is going in NOW - after its REU, which can take longer than
+// the 10 s above (a 16 MB .reu). The clock starts again here, so the cold start that its load causes still
+// counts as "just started" and the program's own animation stays on the front screen while it runs.
+void octo_oled_started()
+{
+	if (!oled_launched) return;
+	oled_launch = GetTimer(0);
